        "type": "base",
        "description": "<p>You attach a small bomb to a creature. If you are hidden from the creature, they don’t notice the bomb and you remain hidden. The creature otherwise notices the bomb and can disarm and re move it as a main action. If they don’t, at the end of your next turn, the bomb detonates. When the bomb detonates, you make a power roll targeting each enemy within 2 squares of it.</p>",
